### Find All Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Me
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authTokenDriver}}

### Create User
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

